{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42776","headline":"春昼醉眠 · 刘兼","name":"春昼醉眠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱栏芳草绿纤纤，欹枕高堂卷昼帘。\n处处落花春寂寂，时时中酒病恹恹。\n塞鸿信断虽堪讶，梁燕词多且莫嫌。\n自有卷书销永日，霜华未用鬓边添。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}